ck reflexes and precision to win.\n\nWhether aiming for a high score or competing with friends for leaderboard domination, Ring Frenzy offers endless fun for all players. The intuitive gameplay is easy to pick up, yet challenging to master, making every session a blast. So gear up, step into the frenzy, and see if you can handle the ring-tossing action before time runs out!", "short_description": "Step into the fast-paced fun of Ring Frenzy, a thrilling VR game where you pick up and toss rings onto sticks to rack up points before the clock runs out. Challenge your skills and aim for the top of the leaderboard in this addictive, action-packed experience. Can you handle the frenzy?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/232cb537-bed2-4054-8663-ae1344f15d80", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nubian Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nubianvr-website.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8955337994516873"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1269781367537488"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1269781367537488"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1730419200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1269781367537488"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typ